  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 66 cyclic shifts, a(x) = x^28 + x^31 + x^35 + x^38, b(x) = x^17 + x^22 + x^44 + x^49 in F_2[x]/(x^66 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^66 - 1)",
